alanced great artist: nerf/reduce early bomb culture instant culture gain from 700 to 500 per era, and increase culture per turn for long term victory culture path or and other uses from 12 to 18 per turn, see sevopedia ingame or xml for latest values if they changed in the meantime and i didn't (re)update them here anyways etc (anyways etc), anyways etc[NEWLINE]- Some civics such as [LINK=CIVIC_REPRESENTATION]CIVIC_REPRESENTATION[\LINK] have been reworked/rebalanced. For example for CIVIC_REPRESENTATION, it is mainly because it is available sooner in advciv-sas mod, but also to tweak or change its effect a bit too anyways etc.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE][BOLD]Fixes[\BOLD][PARAGRAPH:1]Quite many fixes from base advciv +/- civ4, as it woudl be quite tedious but mostly too long to list them all here, please visit info about these here, which are located as of now if i am not mistaken only/mostly in the following docs, in your mod folder offline (with notepad++ or vs code (ideally if online rather than notepad++ as preview display is bit nicer anyways etc but notepad++ has same content just not formatted in markdown pretty view i mean but more like plain text anyways etc) or similar software for example) or online on the github page of the mod directly in:[NEWLINE]- /_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs_And_Appendixes/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md[NEWLINE]- the main README.md, at the fixes/fixed section as well as it has a few other ones not listed in readme known issues anyways etc</English>
